{"id":"ampoule","lemma":"ampoule","pos":"noun","rank":4923,"glosses":["light bulb","ampoule","blister"],"ipa":"/ɑ̃.pul/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/c/c5/Fr-ampoule.ogg/Fr-ampoule.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"ampoules"},"formAudio":{"ampoules":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/9/95/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Lyoko%C3%AF-ampoules.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Une ampoule donne de la lumière.","en":"A light bulb gives light.","words":[{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"to give","l":"donner"},null,null,{"g":"light"}],"phrases":[[3,5,"of the"]]},{"text":"J'ai une ampoule au pied.","en":"I have a blister on my foot.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"a"},null,null,null],"phrases":[[4,6,"to heel!"]]},{"text":"J'ai des ampoules.","en":"I've got blisters.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"some / of the","l":"un"},null]},{"text":"Qui peut me dire comment une ampoule fonctionne ?","en":"Who can tell me how a light bulb works?","words":[{"g":"who"},{"g":"can, to be able to","l":"pouvoir"},{"g":"me"},{"g":"to say, to tell"},{"g":"how"},{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"to function, to work","l":"fonctionner"}]},{"text":"Ces ampoules ne peuvent pas toutes être mauvaises.","en":"These light bulbs can't all be bad.","words":[{"g":"it, this, that","l":"ce"},null,{"g":"not"},{"g":"can, to be able to","l":"pouvoir"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"all","l":"tout"},{"g":"to be"},{"g":"bad","l":"mauvais"}]}]}